      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "I think both are all in the wrong. I understand why people feel they have to do this because of reviewers' use of AI. So on one had we have reviewers shirking their duties. And on the other hand, we have authors trying to exploit to seek unfair advantage.",
